# Document

"document.tip.winCond.pelican.devour.title" : "Devour Trigger"
"document.tip.winCond.pelican.devour" : "The Pelican wins when all players except the Pelican have been devoured or only the Pelican is alive."
"document.tip.winCond.pelican.huntOver.title" : "Hunt Over"
"document.tip.winCond.pelican.huntOver" : "When Hunt is over, the alive Pelicans will win."

"role.pelican.doc" : "A neutral who wins by devouring enemies."
"role.pelican.winCond" : "Win when all players except the Pelican have been devoured or only the Pelican is alive.%WIN%"
"role.pelican.winCond.pelicanHuntOver" : "<br>Moreover, <var>when Hunt is over, the alive Pelicans will also win.</var>"
"role.pelican.ability.title" : "Inherent Ability [Bottomless Appetite]"
"role.pelican.ability.main" : "Can devour a player whole. Devoured players do not die and will be digested when the meeting starts. %PELICANHUNT%"
"role.pelican.ability.devour" : "<title>Devour</title>Devour the player. The devoured player's cam target will be locked to the Pelican."
"role.pelican.ability.pelicanHunt" : "<br>When only <var>%NUM%</var> players are alive, <b>"Pelican Hunt"</b> will begin.<br>During this hunt, no one can report or use vents. It lasts <var>%DURATION%</var>s."
"role.pelican.tips" : "<br>・The role is created by <b>DHMO</b>."

